# Design-review screenshots from the impeccable/visual-qa skills. Regenerated on
# demand; 32MB of PNGs that churn on every review round.
.impeccable/
# Bank and regulator paperwork and ad-hoc screenshots dropped at the root.
# Documents live outside the repo; these rules keep a stray one from being committed.
/*.pdf
/Screenshot *.png

# Premium design benchmark RUNS. Every one of these directories is script output
# (captures, evidence.json, receipt.json and the generated site) — regenerate with
# `pnpm benchmark:source` / the premium-design-benchmark-* scripts rather than
# committing 63MB of it. The benchmark INPUTS are still tracked: the scene-*.jpg
# photos each run consumes, and examples/premium-benchmark-photos/fixtures/.
examples/premium-benchmark/
examples/premium-benchmark-photos/*
!examples/premium-benchmark-photos/fixtures/
!examples/premium-benchmark-photos/*/
examples/premium-benchmark-photos/*/*
!examples/premium-benchmark-photos/*/scene-*.jpg

.yapi-evaluation/

# Screen recordings and the fixit/ scratch folder: ~300MB of media recorded while
# reviewing generations, dropped at the root and in fixit/. Evidence for a
# conversation about a store, never source.
/*.mov
/fixit/
*.bak
